{"seq":1,"slug":"search-ab-metrics","title":"搜索 A/B 的指标与显著性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/experiment-feedback/search-ab-metrics","wordCount":3356,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"搜索-a-b-的指标与显著性\">搜索 A/B 的指标与显著性</h1><p>搜索改动的度量有一类特殊困难：它的效果几乎总会被<strong>位置重分配</strong>污染。把一个新的相关性特征加进排序，短期内它的直接效果是「把某些商品往上提、某些往下压」，因此 CTR 的变化里混着两种成分——相关性真的变好了，还是内容只是被挪到了更容易被点击的位置。只报 CTR 的搜索结果页会系统性地把后者算成前者。本文讲的是搜索实验在指标选择、方差控制与显著性判定上的工程处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-搜索实验的三种随机化单元\">核心概念：搜索实验的三种随机化单元</h2><p>A/B 实验的第一件事是决定「随机化谁」。搜索场景有三种，各有代价。</p>\n<p><strong>用户级随机化（user-level）</strong>：用户被分到 A 组或 B 组，其所有搜索都走对应版本。优点是度量干净（用户之间的干扰被隔离）、能度量长期效果（留存、复购）。缺点是需要的流量大——排序差异在单个用户上的表现被用户间差异淹没，且用户级实验无法在小样本上快速迭代。</p>\n<p><strong>查询级随机化（query-level）</strong>：同一次查询请求被随机分配版本。样本量来自流量而非用户数，因此统计功效高得多、迭代更快。缺点是存在<strong>溢出效应</strong>：用户在 A 组看到的效果可能受他之前在 B 组的体验影响（例如在 B 组加购的商品，在 A 组的转化会被归给 A）。对于排序这类「每次请求相对独立」的改动，溢出较弱，因此查询级是搜索实验的主流选择。</p>\n<p><strong>会话级随机化（session-level）</strong>：介于两者之间，一次会话内保持一致。它在「同会话多次搜索的一致性」与「样本量」之间折中，适用于会改变用户搜索行为的改动（例如新的查询改写会改变用户后续输入）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单元</th>\n<th>统计功效</th>\n<th>溢出风险</th>\n<th>适用改动</th>\n<th>主要限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>长期影响、留存、复购</td>\n<td>需要大流量、周期长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>影响用户搜索行为的改写</td>\n<td>会话边界需稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>排序、召回、位置调整</td>\n<td>需处理用户内相关性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择了单元之后，方差估计必须与之一致。查询级实验里同一个用户贡献多个查询，这些查询的结果<strong>不独立</strong>（同一用户的偏好相似），忽略这一点会把标准误算小、把不显著的差异判成显著。标准做法是用<strong>聚类稳健标准误</strong>（cluster-robust standard error，又称 Liang–Zeger 标准误），聚类键取用户 ID——聚类稳健标准误用于观测可被划入若干组、且组内抽样或处理分配相关的情形（来源：Clustered standard errors（Liang &amp; Zeger, Biometrika 1986）, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clustered_standard_errors\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clustered_standard_errors</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">^</mo></mover><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>u</mi></munder><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\widehat{\\mathrm{SE}}_{\\text{cluster}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{\\sum_{u}\\left(\\sum_{q \\in u} d_{q}\\right)^2}{n^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0733em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9233em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SE</span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.6833em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.24em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"0.24em\" viewBox=\"0 0 1062 239\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22\nc-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cluster</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3078em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6218em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-5.2678em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1.056em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.394em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.668em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.354em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.584em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.354em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.354em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0777em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.354em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.5818em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.2678em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.742em;height:3.3478em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"3.3478em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 3347\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M702 80H40000040\nH742v3213l-4 4-4 4c-.667.7 -2 1.5-4 2.5s-4.167 1.833-6.5 2.5-5.5 1-9.5 1\nh-12l-28-84c-16.667-52-96.667 -294.333-240-727l-212 -643 -85 170\nc-4-3.333-8.333-7.667-13 -13l-13-13l77-155 77-156c66 199.333 139 419.667\n219 661 l218 661zM702 80H400000v40H742z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 上的指标差值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是查询数。当用户内相关性为正时，这个值大于按查询独立假设计算的标准误——后者是搜索实验里最常见的假阳性来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"位置偏差与指标选择\">位置偏差与指标选择</h2><p>搜索实验的度量必须处理位置偏差，因为排序改动<strong>本质上就在改变位置分配</strong>。三种应对方式。</p>\n<p><strong>用位置校正后的指标做主判据。</strong> <a href=\"../search-funnel-metrics/ctr-cvr-attribution\">CTR/CVR 与归因窗口/位置</a> 给出的校正 CTR 在实验中的用途是：把「位置重分配」这个中介变量的影响剥离，得到更接近「相关性变化」的度量。当原始 CTR 与校正 CTR 方向一致时，结论稳健；方向不一致时，优先级高于一切其他指标——它意味着这次改动主要是位置游戏。</p>\n<p><strong>把位置分配本身当作一个结果变量。</strong> 实验报告里应当有「内容被重排的程度」这一指标（例如与对照组的排序结果的平均 Kendall&#39;s <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 距离，或 top-10 集合的 Jaccard 重叠度）。重排幅度大而质量指标无变化的实验，说明这个特征几乎只是噪声；重排幅度小而质量指标有提升的实验，说明特征在做精细区分。这个维度让「有用」这个模糊判断有了方向。</p>\n<p><strong>区分排名质量的直接度量与行为代理。</strong> 有标注数据的团队可以直接算 NDCG 一类的排序质量指标，它是无偏的（不依赖用户行为），但依赖标注的覆盖与质量（NDCG 由 Järvelin 与 Kekäläinen 于 2000-2002 年提出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nDCG_p = DCG_p / IDCG_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用理想排序的 DCG 归一化使分数跨查询可比；来源：Järvelin &amp; Kekäläinen, &quot;Cumulated gain-based evaluation of IR techniques&quot;, ACM TOIS 2002, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Discounted_cumulative_gain\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Discounted_cumulative_gain</a>）。行为指标（CTR、CVR）覆盖全流量但有偏。实验判定建议两者都看：标注指标为负而行为指标为正，通常说明标注集与线上分布不一致，需要先修评估集而不是上线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方差缩减-cuped-与配对设计\">方差缩减：CUPED 与配对设计</h2><p>搜索结果页的指标方差很大，因为不同查询的量级与基线差异极大（一个品牌词和一个探索词的 CTR 可以差五倍）。这导致实验需要很长的运行时间才能检出小幅改动。方差缩减技术因此成为搜索实验的标配。</p>\n<p><strong>CUPED（Controlled-experiment Using Pre-Experiment Data）</strong> 的核心思路是用实验前的一段数据作为协变量，把指标中可被前期行为解释的部分减掉：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>cv</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>X</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{\\text{cv}} = Y - \\theta\\left(X - \\bar{X}\\right), \\quad \\theta = \\frac{\\mathrm{Cov}(Y, X)}{\\mathrm{Var}(X)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 是同一单元在实验前的同指标（例如该用户或该查询簇在实验前一周的 CTR），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 是实验期指标。因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 在分组前就已确定，它与分组无关，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mtext>cv</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{\\text{cv}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 仍然是无偏的估计，而它的方差是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Var}(Y)(1-\\rho^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 是与前期指标的相关性。CUPED 由微软研究院的 Deng、Xu、Kohavi、Walker 在 2013 年的 WSDM 论文中提出，其调整量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y^{cv} = Y - \\theta X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = \\mathrm{Cov}(X,Y)/\\mathrm{Var}(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，代入最优 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 后方差降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Var}(Y)(1-\\rho^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，即可实现的方差降幅为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（来源：Deng, Xu, Kohavi, Walker, &quot;Improving the Sensitivity of Online Controlled Experiments by Utilizing Pre-Experiment Data&quot;, WSDM 2013, <a href=\"https://exp-platform.com/Documents/2013-02-CUPED-ImprovingSensitivityOfControlledExperiments.pdf\">https://exp-platform.com/Documents/2013-02-CUPED-ImprovingSensitivityOfControlledExperiments.pdf</a>）。在搜索场景中，查询簇级别的 CTR 周与周相关性通常在 0.5~0.8，因此方差可降 25%~60%，等效于把实验所需流量降低同样比例。</p>\n<p><strong>配对设计与查询分层。</strong> 在分配时把相似查询（同意图、同量级、同市场）配成对，组内随机分到 A/B 两侧，这样两组的查询构成天然平衡。它比事后分层更彻底，因为它同时降低方差与消除构成差异带来的偏差。实现上需要一个稳定的查询特征快照（实验开始前生成），避免用实验期特征做配对——那会引入循环。</p>\n<p><strong>interleaving（交错评估）。</strong> 这是一种不同于 A/B 的评估范式：对同一次查询，把 A 与 B 两组排序结果交错混排成一个列表，让用户与之交互，然后统计用户点击更偏向哪一组。它的统计功效比 A/B 高一个数量级（因为比较发生在<strong>同一查询内</strong>，查询间差异被完全消除）。代价是它只回答「哪个排序更好」，不回答「业务指标提升多少」，且不能度量长期效果。因此 interleaving 的定位是<strong>快速筛选候选</strong>（一天内筛掉 90% 的无效改动），A/B 用于确认最终效果。该方法由 Radlinski 与 Joachims 等人提出并持续演进，用以在不做全量 A/B 的情况下比较两套排序（来源：Radlinski &amp; Craswell, &quot;Optimized interleaving for online retrieval evaluation&quot;, WSDM 2013, <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1145/2433396.2433429\">https://doi.org/10.1145/2433396.2433429</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>方差缩减</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>不能做什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CUPED</td>\n<td>25%~60%</td>\n<td>效果多大</td>\n<td>A/B 主分析</td>\n<td>不消除未被建模的偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配对/分层分配</td>\n<td>视分层解释力</td>\n<td>效果多大</td>\n<td>提高 A/B 功效</td>\n<td>分层维度需先验可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>interleaving</td>\n<td>约一个数量级</td>\n<td>哪个排序更好</td>\n<td>候选快速筛选</td>\n<td>不给业务指标幅度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置校正</td>\n<td>不降方差</td>\n<td>相关性是否真变好</td>\n<td>结果解释</td>\n<td>不代替显著性检验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"显著性判定的工程纪律\">显著性判定的工程纪律</h2><p><strong>不要提前偷看。</strong> 搜索实验最常见的破坏方式是「看几天，显著就停」。这会大幅推高假阳性率——因为指标是随机游走的，总有一个时点看起来显著。正确做法是预先算定样本量与运行时长（用最小可检测效应 MDE 与基线方差反推），到点再看。</p>\n<p><strong>多重比较必须校正。</strong> 一个搜索实验通常同时看 CTR、CVR、GMV、零结果率、退出率、延迟等十几个指标。按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> 逐个判定，至少一个假阳性的概率接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>0.95</mn><mn>15</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>54</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-0.95^{15} \\approx 54\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">15</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">54%</span></span></span></span></span>。处理方式有两种：一是**预先指定一个主指标（OEC，overall evaluation criterion）**并只对它做严格检验，其余为辅助指标需附加解释；二是对辅助指标做多重比较校正（Bonferroni 或 Benjamini-Hochberg——后者控制的是错误发现率 FDR，即被拒绝的原假设中为假的期望比例，步骤是取满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{(k)} \\le \\frac{k}{m}\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的最大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>；来源：Benjamini &amp; Hochberg, JRSS-B 57(1), 1995, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/False_discovery_rate\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/False_discovery_rate</a>）。搜索实验推荐第一种，因为搜索改动的价值判断往往集中在「搜索带来的成交」上，同时看十几个指标的决策方式实际上是在事后选对自己有利的指标。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱指标要预先声明。</strong> 有三类指标在搜索实验中几乎必然给出误导性的显著结果，必须在实验前声明如何处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>延迟类</strong>：新特征必然增加计算量，延迟上升本身不构成阻止上线的理由，但要把延迟换算成容量成本并纳入决策。</li>\n<li><strong>长尾指标</strong>：分市场的分品类指标量小，极易随机显著。做法是只在主指标显著后才看分层，且分层结果用于诊断而非判决。</li>\n<li><strong>有界比率在小分母上</strong>：零结果率在一个小市场的小品类上会有剧烈波动（见 <a href=\"../search-funnel-metrics/zero-result-exit-rate\">零结果率与搜索退出率</a>），必须设最小样本量门。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[候选改动] --&gt; B{能否快速筛}&#10;    B --&gt;|能| C[interleaving 一天筛]&#10;    C --&gt;|A不比B好| D[淘汰 不进A/B]&#10;    C --&gt;|B更好| E[进入A/B]&#10;    B --&gt;|否 长期影响| E&#10;    E --&gt; F[选随机化单元]&#10;    F --&gt; G[预先算 MDE 与样本量]&#10;    G --&gt; H[CUPED 与配对降低方差]&#10;    H --&gt; I[固定时长跑完]&#10;    I --&gt; J{主指标显著且无反向陷阱}&#10;    J --&gt;|否| K[不上线 记录结论]&#10;    J --&gt;|是| L[分层诊断 位置重排程度]&#10;    L --&gt; M[灰度放量 观察长期指标]\">graph TD\n    A[候选改动] --&gt; B{能否快速筛}\n    B --&gt;|能| C[interleaving 一天筛]\n    C --&gt;|A不比B好| D[淘汰 不进A/B]\n    C --&gt;|B更好| E[进入A/B]\n    B --&gt;|否 长期影响| E\n    E --&gt; F[选随机化单元]\n    F --&gt; G[预先算 MDE 与样本量]\n    G --&gt; H[CUPED 与配对降低方差]\n    H --&gt; I[固定时长跑完]\n    I --&gt; J{主指标显著且无反向陷阱}\n    J --&gt;|否| K[不上线 记录结论]\n    J --&gt;|是| L[分层诊断 位置重排程度]\n    L --&gt; M[灰度放量 观察长期指标]</pre><h2 id=\"从实验结论到上线决策\">从实验结论到上线决策</h2><p>统计显著不等于应该上线。三个补充判据。</p>\n<p><strong>效应量要大于噪声与成本。</strong> 一个 p 值 0.01、CTR 提升 0.3% 的改动，其收益可能小于新增特征带来的计算成本。实验报告里应当把效应量换算成可比的业务量（例如「每月搜索 GMV 增加 X 万元」「每月额外计算成本 Y 元」），让决策有共同的尺度。</p>\n<p><strong>结论要能被独立复现。</strong> 一个实验的胜出结论在被推广到全量前，应当在<strong>另一方流量</strong>上复现一次（不同的市场或不同的时间窗）。搜索系统有强烈的周内与季节性模式，单周期的胜出可能是特定商品池的结果。复现失败时，结论应回到「条件性成立」而不是直接推翻——它可能在特定流量条件下确实有效，这个条件本身是有价值的信息。</p>\n<p><strong>反向指标要有一票否决权。</strong> 有一些指标即使主指标显著为正也应当阻止上线：跨市场一致性的破坏（一个市场涨、另一个市场大跌）、零结果率的显著上升、可售商品覆盖的下降。这些指标共同代表「用一部分用户换取另一部分用户的收益」或「把问题藏到下游」，把它们设为否决项是必要的工程纪律。</p>\n<p>实验的产出最终要进入变更流程——补同义词、调权重、改运营位——这部分契约见 <a href=\"insight-to-action\">洞察反哺运营（补词/调权重/活动）</a>。而在整条链路上，参与实验的用户行为数据本身就是个人数据，其采集、保留与传输的边界见 <a href=\"analytics-privacy\">行为分析的数据合规边界</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>搜索实验的随机化单元有三种：用户级（功效低、溢出小、可测长期）、会话级（折中）、查询级（功效高、需聚类稳健标准误）。</li>\n<li>排序改动本质上改变位置分配，因此必须用位置校正指标、报告重排幅度，并区分标注指标与行为指标。</li>\n<li>方差缩减靠 CUPED（方差降 25%~60%）、配对分配与分层；interleaving 用于快速筛选而非最终判定。</li>\n<li>显著性纪律：不提前偷看、预先指定主指标、辅助指标做多重比较校正、预先声明陷阱指标。</li>\n<li>上线决策的标准高于统计显著：效应量要换算成业务量、结论要在另一方流量复现、反向指标有一票否决权。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    H[主指标显著] --&gt; H1{效应量大于成本}&#10;    H1 --&gt;|否| X[不上线]&#10;    H1 --&gt;|是| H2{另一方流量复现}&#10;    H2 --&gt;|失败| H3[条件性成立 记录边界]&#10;    H2 --&gt;|成功| H4{反向指标}&#10;    H4 --&gt;|跨市场一致性破坏| X&#10;    H4 --&gt;|零结果率上升| X&#10;    H4 --&gt;|可售覆盖下降| X&#10;    H4 --&gt;|全部通过| H5[灰度放量]&#10;    H5 --&gt; H6[观察长期指标 留存/复购]\">graph TD\n    H[主指标显著] --&gt; H1{效应量大于成本}\n    H1 --&gt;|否| X[不上线]\n    H1 --&gt;|是| H2{另一方流量复现}\n    H2 --&gt;|失败| H3[条件性成立 记录边界]\n    H2 --&gt;|成功| H4{反向指标}\n    H4 --&gt;|跨市场一致性破坏| X\n    H4 --&gt;|零结果率上升| X\n    H4 --&gt;|可售覆盖下降| X\n    H4 --&gt;|全部通过| H5[灰度放量]\n    H5 --&gt; H6[观察长期指标 留存/复购]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"搜索 A/B 的指标与显著性","id":"搜索-a-b-的指标与显著性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：搜索实验的三种随机化单元","id":"核心概念-搜索实验的三种随机化单元"},{"level":2,"text":"位置偏差与指标选择","id":"位置偏差与指标选择"},{"level":2,"text":"方差缩减：CUPED 与配对设计","id":"方差缩减-cuped-与配对设计"},{"level":2,"text":"显著性判定的工程纪律","id":"显著性判定的工程纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"从实验结论到上线决策","id":"从实验结论到上线决策"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"采样、基数与成本控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/event-pipeline/sampling-cardinality"},"next":{"title":"洞察反哺运营（补词/调权重/活动）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/experiment-feedback/insight-to-action"}}